# =============================================================================
# Engine configuration is now consolidated into the repo-root MASTER .env.
# There is ONE place to configure everything:
#
#     cp ../.env.example ../.env      # then edit the repo-root .env
#
# The engine reads that master automatically (its "Engine" section, prefix
# L2ARB__). You may still drop a local `.env` HERE for standalone engine work —
# it OVERRIDES the master; real environment variables override both.
#
# HARD RULE: this engine is DETECTION-ONLY — no private keys, ever. Every value
# is a read endpoint or a tuning knob (see engine/CLAUDE.md §1 and
# docs/DATA_INTEGRITY.md).
#
# Blockscout independent verification needs ONLY an API key; the per-chain
# explorer endpoints are built into the engine, so this is all it takes:
#
#     L2ARB__BLOCKSCOUT__API_KEY=your-blockscout-api-key
#
# =============================================================================
